# jemdoc: menu{menu.jemdoc}{gallery.html}, notime
= Gallery
Photos of the group

We try to take a group photo at least once a year. To add one, put the image file into the
+images+ folder of +www+ and paste the +figure+ template from the bottom of this file into the
gallery below.

~~~
{}{raw}
<div class="gallery">
</div>
~~~

== Videos and talks

- Group seminar recordings (link to be added).
- Recorded conference talks (link to be added).

